# Proxy pool for the Railway farm, one proxy per line.
# This file is gitignored.
#
# Sticky: 1 account = 1 egress. The browser (OAuth) and every post-auth GraphQL
# call use the same proxy, so Railway/Google see one consistent IP per account.
#
# multi-warp output (warp-pool.txt) drops in verbatim:
#   socks5://127.0.0.1:40001
#   socks5://127.0.0.1:40002
# ...
#
# Other accepted formats:
#   socks5://user:pass@host:port
#   http://user:pass@host:port
#   host:port
#
# Empty/absent file => every account egresses from the local IP.
